ad secretly followed her. She only realized this when she heard his screams as he was being carried off by a band of trolls.\n\nThey were too strong for her, and she had to watch helplessly from a distance as he was taken to their cave in the mountains via a winding route through the Dwarven lands. She was able to track them, but she needs your help to defeat the beasts and bring him back safely. It's only a matter of time before they eat him, so time is of the essence. Can you be the heroes that she needs?", "summary": "Toward The Ice is a classic first-person party-based dungeon crawler RPG with grid-based movement and turn-based combat. Venture into the frozen north and help a fair princess rescue her idiot brother from Troll kidnappers.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/toward-the-ice", "videos": [{"id": 171626, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "ZaAoQ7czBIQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZaAoQ7czBIQ", "title": "Toward The Ice - Gameplay Demo (December 2025)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZaAoQ7czBIQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}